  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>For the purpose of extended metaphor, when your cup overflows with moxie, you know how to add a bit more on top as a sort of foam.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Moxie pool class trigger, triggerman level 5th</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you would gain 2 or more moxie points while you already have 4 moxie points, you gain a temporary moxie point that lasts for 1 hour. Your moxie talents that are marked with an asterisk (*) treat temporary moxie points sourced from Moxie Stacking as though they were actual moxie points in your moxie pool for the purpose of determining the magnitude of their scaling.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/triggerman-feats#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
